<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Interstate Hotels started.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Interstate Hotels started.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Morgan Stanley said analyst Neil Barsky started coverage of Interstate Hotels Co with an outperform rating.  </p>
<p>-- Barsky said he, together with fellow analyst Nicole Zatlyn, set earnings per share estimates for Interstate Hotel of $0.89 per share for 1996 and $1.16 for 1997.</p>
<p>-- The analysts set a 12-month target price of $32, Barsky said.</p>
<p>-- E. Auchard, Wall Street Bureau 212-859-1736</p>
